n22. should round premium of 197.5 G up to 198 G in MHPCO's favor\n23. should round payout of 350.5 G down to 350 G in MHPCO's favor\n24. should apply 100 G deductible per damage event\n25. should cap total payout per policy at twice the insurance sum\n26. should reimburse 400 G for regular sword (steel, enchantment 3) with 500 G damage -- full minus 100 G deductible\n27. should reimburse 100 G for rune with 200 G damage -- full minus 100 G deductible\n28. should reimburse 400 G for dragon-material sword, enchantment 9, 1000 G damage -- 50% rule wins, then deductible\n29. should reimburse 700 G for dragon-material sword, enchantment 5, 800 G damage -- dragon-material clause applies\n30. should reimburse 400 G for steel sword, enchantment 9, 1000 G damage -- high-enchantment clause applies\n31. should support policy with two swords -- insurance sum 2000 G, cap 4000 G\n32. should apply separate 100 G deductible for each damaged sword in dragon attack\n33."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784951282729,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-1a31046e-3ddd-4a45-8ffe-54f0532971e3","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}},"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Test List\n\nTest List Created:\n**Feature**: Claim Office premium calculation and claim processing\n**Test File**: src/claim-office.spec.ts\n**Tests**: 35\n\n**Test Cases** (ordered simple -> complex):\n1. should compute premium for empty item list as 5 G -- processing fee only\n2. should compute 100 G base premium for a sword\n3. should compute 60 G base premium for an amulet\n4. should compute 80 G base premium for a staff\n5. should compute 40 G base premium for a potion\n6. should compute 25 G base premium per component (rune or moonstone)\n